@startuml
title Vapor Desktop Surface Model

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false

state "Steam App Instance" as INSTALLATION {
    state "Vapor Desktop Application" as DESKTOP {
        state "Launcher Mode" as LAUNCHER
        state "SDK / Development Mode" as SDK

        LAUNCHER --> SDK : Enter Development
        SDK --> LAUNCHER : Return to Launcher
    }

    state "Vapor Installer" as INSTALLER
}

note right of LAUNCHER
Ordinary product operation

Apps
Content Library
Composition
Accounts
Settings
Diagnostics
end note

note right of SDK
Development-oriented superset

Everything relevant from Launcher
+
Superworkspace Explorer
Projects / source
Editors
Inspector
Graphs
Build / Test / Run
Problems
Git
Toolchain
Publication
Deployment
Ecosystem development
end note

note bottom of INSTALLER
Separate boundary.

Changes installed Role/tooling
and fundamental Installation capability.

SDK is NOT a superset of Installer.
end note

@enduml